    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>60192</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>へへ……ご苦労さまでございやす。
手配書のソーマ使い一行を
お届けにあがりやした</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hehe... thank you for all the hard work. I'm here to hand over those wanted Somatics.</EnglishText>
