    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>61196</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ふ〜む……全員手配書通りだな。
さすがはガネット。
短期間でよく揃えるものだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmm... That's Garnet for you. Who else could get things sorted this quick.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>61196</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よし、人目につかぬように
奥に控えさせておけ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>All right, I'll file this descreetly in the back.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
