      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>61324</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>へへ……
では、通していただきやす</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Heh... Well then, let's head inside shall we?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>62668</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これは……どういう事？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What... was that about?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>62876</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なぁに、軍は事件の犯人が
捕まらない時は、役者を偽の犯人に
したてあげて発表するんでさぁ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You see, when the military fails to capture the culprit, they need someone to play the part and make a false announcement.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>62876</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>治安よりも面子が大事でやすから。
その偽者役者を用意するのは
便利屋の役目……という訳でして</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Keeping up appearanced is all they really care about. And in times like these, it's a handyman's duty to provide said actor.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>63004</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そんなのって……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But that's...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>63132</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そう、腐ってまさぁ。
軍だけでなく、教会も帝国も
……世の中全部が、ね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Despicable? Don't I know it. And it's not just the military, but the church, the empire... hell, so is the entire world.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>63132</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さ、次は地下牢を目指しやすぜ</JapaneseText>
