      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>2</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76556</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ショウシャじゃない！
少佐とよべ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's COMMANDER, not “COMMONER”!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>3</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76556</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>少佐だってば!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>IT'S COMMANDER!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>4</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76556</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今度まちがえたら
グンポーカイギにかけるぞ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If you get it wrong again, you're getting court-martialed!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>4</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76556</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いいか！
黒い月のみはりをつづけるぞ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Soldier! Keep watching the Ebony Moon!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>5</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76556</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……少佐って言えなくても
怒らないから、もう泣くなよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I promise I won't get mad, even if you don't call me commander. So please... don't cry, okay?</EnglishText>
