    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76648</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今の皇帝陛下なんて、お飾りさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The current Empress in nothing but a figurehead.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76648</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>『皇帝』という大義名分を
教会と軍のトップが奪い合って
いるのさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's really just the leaders of the church and military fighting for the title of “emperor”.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>2</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76648</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>自分たちが権力を握るためにね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That way they can seize power over us.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>2</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76648</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>結晶騎士が皇帝暗殺容疑者……
……そろそろ始まったのかな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A Crystal Knight suspected for the assassination the Empress... I guess it's about to go down, how?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>3</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76648</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>軍と教会の争いが
いよいよ血を見る段階に
なったのかも……ね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Guess the conflict has finally reached a tipping point. How long to we start seeing bloodshed, you think...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>4</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76648</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうさ、こんなヌルイ平和が
ずっと続くはずはなかったのさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Of course, there's no way this kind of peace could last forever.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>5</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76648</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ははは、うぬぼれた人間たちが
おとぎ話の魔王に滅ぼされるなんて
傑作じゃないか！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hahaha, what a beautiful twist of irony that is vain humans are to be destroyed by the demon of fairy tale himself!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>6</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76648</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ふん、つながりの力……ね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmm, the power of bonds... huh?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>7</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76648</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>現実問題として
どうやって黒い月まで行くんだ？
どうやって黒い月を倒すんだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Is there any way to realistically reach the Ebony Moon? And if we can, how are we supposed to defeat it?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>8</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76648</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうしようもないだろ!?
もう世界は……終わりなのさ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Can't you see there's nothing we can do?! The world's already doomed...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>8</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76740</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>カレと待ち合わせしてるの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm waiting for my boyfriend.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76740</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私のカレは
帝国軍の兵士さんなのよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>He's an imperial soldier, you see.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>2</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76740</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>カレと待ち合わせを
してたんだけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I was supposed to meet up with my boyfriend...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>3</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76740</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>凶悪なテロリストが逃亡したせいで
カレ、帰れなくなっちゃったの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But he can't get off work because that heinous terrorist escaped.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>4</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76740</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>カレが帰ってくるのを
待ってるの……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm waiting for my boyfriend...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>5</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76740</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今、カレはプランスールって
街に出張中なのよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Right now he's off at Pransule for work.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>6</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76740</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お土産を買ってくるよなんて
言ってたけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>He said he'd bring me back a souvenir...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>6</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76740</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>早く帰ってきてくれるのが
一番嬉しいな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But all I really want is for him to come back soon.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <SubId>6</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76740</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>プランスールに行ったカレが
まだ帰ってこないの……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My boyfriend still hasn't come back from Pransule...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>7</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76740</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>けど、私……
カレの無事を信じて待つわ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But... all I can do is have faith and hope he's safe.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>8</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76740</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……待つのは得意だもの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...It's okay, I'm a very patient person.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>8</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76832</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……信じられんなぁ??</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Can ya believe it?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76832</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どこぞの街では空飛ぶ船が
つくられたというが
アンタ、信じられるかね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They say some city's built ships that fly through the air, but can ya believe that?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>2</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76832</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……信じられんわ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well I ain't buyin' it!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>3</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76832</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まさか教会が
皇帝陛下の暗殺を
企むなんて??</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Is the church plannin' on assassinating the empress?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>4</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76832</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……信じられるかっ!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Can ya believe it?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>5</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76832</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>エメラルドの髪のお姫様が
現実にいたなんて！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I just saw a real life Sleepin' Beauty with emerald hair and everythin'!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>6</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76832</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……空に浮かぶ月の怪物を
どうにかできるなんて
信じられる訳なかろう……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There's no way I'm gonna believe the moon's really some monster floatin' in the sky...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>7</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76832</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……だが、信じねば全て終わりなら
わしは信じてやる！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...But if I don't we're all dead, so dammit I'm believin'!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>8</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76832</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>『信じられん事が起こる』と
信じるぞぉぉーーーっ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I believe something truly unbelievable's gonna happen!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>8</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
